          "body": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p>Hi {{first_name}},<br /><br /></p>\n<p>Welcome to Camp Snooze! 🏕️<br /><br /></p>\n<p>Congratulations on signing up to our most transformative support experience. Here is a couple of things we need you to do before camp begins:<br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>1. Download the Kajabi App for the Best&nbsp;Camp Experience</strong></p>\n<p><br />If you haven't done so already, did you know you can access all your Snooze resources on-the-go with the Kajabi app?:<br /><br /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kajabi/id1485646310\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; background: #2D5016; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; margin-right: 10px;\">📱 Download for iOS</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=kajabi.kajabiapp&amp;pcampaignid=web_share\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; background: #2D5016; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;\">📱 Download for Android</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; color: #7c8a98;\">Once downloaded, log in with your email and password to access all your Snooze content.<br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>2. Complete Your Camp Snooze Intake Form <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">IMPORTANT<br /></span></strong><br /> Please complete your intake form as soon as possible. Sally and Bec use this information to create your personalised sleep plan for camp.<br /><br /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/JxzVuV4LBdjRvkZf6\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2rem; background: #2D5016; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;\">Complete Your Intake Form &rarr;</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/JxzVuV4LBdjRvkZf6\" style=\"color: #2d5016; font-weight: 600;\">https://forms.gle/JxzVuV4LBdjRvkZf6</a></p>\n<p><strong>3. What Happens Next for Camp Snooze</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"color: #1f293b; line-height: 2; margin-top: 0;\">\n<li><strong>A couple of&nbsp;days before camp:</strong> You'll receive your packing list and custom sleep&nbsp;plan</li>\n<li><strong>Before camp starts:</strong>&nbsp;Inside the Snooze Village, you'll get access to the private Camp Snooze&nbsp;channel for your intake</li>\n<li><strong>When camp begins:</strong> Join the live calls And get dedicated support as you implement your plan</li>\n<li><strong>Each morning during camp:</strong> Daily roll call at 10-11am AEDT / 8-9pm ET (recordings available)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Questions?</strong><br />The best way to get specific questions answered is to email <a href=\"mailto:sally@joinsnooze.com\" style=\"color: #2d5016; font-weight: 600;\">sally@joinsnooze.com</a>. We're here to help.<br /><br /></p>\n<p>See you at camp roll call! 🏕️<br /><br /></p>\n<p>Sally + Bec</p>\n</div>",
